#. Tag: title
#: kppp-faq.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Questions and Answers"
msgstr "Pitanja i odgovori"

#. Tag: chapter
#: kppp-faq.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "&reporting.bugs;"
msgstr "&reporting.bugs;"

#. Tag: title
#: kppp-faq.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Questions about Dialing"
msgstr "Pitanja o pozivanju"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I can't get &kppp; to work. &kppp; tells me <application>pppd</application> "
"has died or that a timeout has expired. What's going on?"
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu postaviti &kppp; da radi. &kppp; mi govori da je <application>pppd</"
"application> prestao sa radom ili je pauza istekla. Šta se dešava?"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Did you read this manual carefully? Here are once more the most common "
"pitfalls:"
msgstr ""
"Da li ste pažljivo pročitali ovaj priručnik? Evo još jednom šta su najčešće "
"klopke:"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the <guibutton>Details</guibutton> button. &kppp; will you give an "
"excerpt from the <acronym>PPP</acronym> log messages (may not work on non-"
"&Linux; systems, or even on some &Linux; distributions). The log will help "
"you to track down the bug."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na dugme <guibutton>Detalji</guibutton> . &kppp; će Vam dati izvod "
"iz <acronym>PPP</acronym> dnevnika poruka (možda neće raditi na ne-&Linux; "
"sistemima, ili čak na nekim &Linux; distribucijama). Dnevnik će Vam pomoći "
"da uočite grešku."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make sure that <application>pppd</application> is the actual "
"<application>pppd</application> binary not a script"
msgstr ""
"Budite sigurni da je <application>pppd</application> zapravo "
"<application>pppd</application> binarni a ne tekstualni"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make sure that <application>pppd</application> is setuid <systemitem>root</"
"systemitem>. You may set this mode by issuing <userinput><command>chmod</"
"command> <option>u+s pppd</option></userinput> as <systemitem>root</"
"systemitem>."
msgstr ""
"Budite sigurni da je <application>pppd</application> setuid "
"<systemitem>root</systemitem>. Možete postaviti ovaj mod izdavanjem "
"<userinput><command>chmod</command> <option>u+s pppd</option></userinput> "
"kao <systemitem>root</systemitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make sure that your <filename>/etc/ppp/options</filename> file exists and "
"that it doesn't contain any conflicting entries. If in doubt: Leave this "
"file empty."
msgstr ""
"Budite sigurni da Vaša datoteka <filename>/etc/ppp/options</filename> "
"postoji i da ne sadrši neke konfliktne unose. Ako sumnjate: Ostavite ovu "
"datoteku praznom."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make sure that you <emphasis>don't</emphasis> use the option <option>lock</"
"option> as an argument for <application>pppd</application> (&kppp; is "
"already taking care of device locking)."
msgstr ""
"Budite sigurni da <emphasis>ne</emphasis> koristite opciju <option>lock</"
"option>  kao argument za <application>pppd</application> (&kppp; već vodi "
"brigu o zaključavanju uređaja)."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Remove the <option>lock</option> option from <emphasis>both</emphasis> your "
"<filename>/etc/ppp/options</filename> <emphasis>and</emphasis> "
"<filename>&tilde;/.ppprc</filename> files!"
msgstr ""
"Uklonite opciju<option>lock</option>  iz <emphasis>obje</emphasis> datoteke: "
"<filename>/etc/ppp/options</filename> <emphasis>i</emphasis> "
"<filename>&tilde;/.ppprc</filename>"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using the symbolic link <filename class=\"symlink\">/dev/modem</filename> "
"may cause some conflicts. Eliminate this source of trouble by using the real "
"device, &ie; <filename>/dev/cuaX</filename> or <filename>/dev/ttySX</"
"filename>."
msgstr ""
"Korištenje simboličnog linka <filename class=\"symlink\">/dev/modem</"
"filename> može prouzrokovati neke konflikte. Eliminišite ovaj izvor problema "
"korištenjem pravog uređaja &ie; <filename>/dev/cuaX</filename> ili "
"<filename>/dev/ttySX</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<hardware>COM1</hardware> equals <filename>ttyS0</filename>, <hardware>COM2</"
"hardware> is <filename>ttyS1</filename> and so on."
msgstr ""
"<hardware>COM1</hardware> jednako <filename>ttyS0</filename>, "
"<hardware>COM2</hardware> je <filename>ttyS1</filename> i tako dalje."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make sure you set the right permission. In case of trouble you might want to "
"run it as root first and then later, when everything is working fine give it "
"less harmful permission if you can not afford to run &kppp; setuid "
"<systemitem>root</systemitem>. The proper way to proceed would probably be "
"creating a <systemitem>modem</systemitem> group."
msgstr ""
"Budite sigurni da ste postavili ispravna povlaštenja. U slučaju problema "
"bilo bi poželjno da ga pokrenete kao korijen i onda kasnije, kada sve bude "
"radilo kako treba dodijelite mu manje štetna povlaštenja ako si ne možete "
"priuštiti da pokrečete &kppp; setuid <systemitem>korijen</systemitem>. "
"Ispravan postupak bi najvjerovatnije bio da kreirate <systemitem>modem</"
"systemitem> grupu."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You might be launching <application>pppd</application> too early, &ie; "
"before the remote server is ready to negotiate a <acronym>PPP</acronym> "
"connection. If you are using a login script, you should use the built-in "
"terminal to verify your login procedure. Some providers will require you to "
"issue a simple <command>Send</command> or <command>Send ppp</command> to "
"launch <acronym>PPP</acronym>. Some users even reported, that they had to "
"append <command>Pause 1</command> or <command>Pause 2</command> to their "
"script to solve timing conflicts."
msgstr ""
"Moguće je da pokrećete <application>pppd</application> prerano, &ie; prije "
"nego je udaljeni server spreman na saradnju sa <acronym>PPP</acronym> "
"konekcijom. Ako koristite prijavnu skriptu, trebali biste koristiti ugrađeni "
"terminal kako biste potvrdili prijavnu proceduru. Neki provajderi će Vam "
"tražiti da izdate jednostavnu <command>Šalji</command> ili <command>Šalji "
"ppp</command>komandu da pokrenete  <acronym>PPP</acronym>. Neki korisnici su "
"također potvrdili da su morali dodati <command>Pauza 1</command> ili "
"<command>Pauza 2</command> komandu skripti da riješe konflikte tajminga."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If nothing helps, you might obtain some debugging info from your systems log "
"by issuing:"
msgstr ""
"Ako ništa ne pomaže, mogli biste dobiti sistemske informacije o rješavanju "
"problema iz dnevnika Vašeg sistema izdavanjem:"

#. Tag: screen
#: kppp-faq.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>#</prompt> <userinput><command>tail</command> <filename>/var/log/"
"messages</filename></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>#</prompt> <userinput><command>rep</command> <filename>/var/log/"
"messages</filename></userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "pppd died - The remote system is required to authenticate itself ..."
msgstr ""
"pppd je prekinuo sa radom - Potrebno je da udaljeni sistem provjeri svoju "
"autentičnost..."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Typical error message in system log:"
msgstr "Tipična poruka greške u sistemskom dnevniku:"

#. Tag: screen
#: kppp-faq.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"pppd[699]: The remote system is required to authenticate itself\n"
"pppd[699]: but I couldn't find any suitable secret (password) for it to use "
"to do so.\n"
"pppd[699]: (None of the available passwords would let it use an IP address.)"
msgstr ""
"pppd[699]: Potrebno je da udaljeni sistem provjeri svoju autentičnost\n"
"pppd[699]: ali ne mogu naći neku prikladnu tajnu(šifru) za to da bih to "
"uradio.\n"
"pppd[699]: (Nijedna od dostupnih šifri neće dopustiti korištenje IP adrese.)"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "As far as I can tell there are two causes for this problem:"
msgstr "Koliko ja znam, dva su moguća uzroka ovog problema:"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>/etc/ppp/options</filename> contains the <option>auth</option> "
"option. Simply put a <prompt>#</prompt> comment in front and try again."
msgstr ""
"<filename>/etc/ppp/options</filename> sadrži <option>auth</option> opciju. "
"Jednostavno ostavite <prompt>#</prompt> komentar ispred i pokušajte ponovo."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your system already has a default route. Have you set up a local network? In "
"this case recent versions of pppd will behave as if <option>auth</option> "
"had been specified. To override this you may add <option>noauth</option> to "
"the pppd arguments in kppp' setup dialog. Alternatively you could take down "
"the local network prior to dialing in. I'd be thankful if someone could "
"provide instructions on how to peacefully combine the two network "
"connections."
msgstr ""
"Vaš sistem već posjeduje zadanu rutu. Jeste li postavili lokalnu mrežu? U "
"ovom slučaju nedavne verzije pppd-a će se ponašati kao da je specificirana "
"opcija <option>auth</option>. Da prevaziđete ovo možete dodati "
"<option>noauth</option> u pppd argumente u kppp-ovom dijalogu za postavke. "
"Alternativno biste mogli skinuti prošlu lokalnu mrežu za pozivanje. Bio bih "
"zahvalan kada bi neko mogao obezbijediti instrukcije kako mirno kombinovati "
"dvije mrežne konekcije."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "pppd dies with 2.4.x Linux kernel"
msgstr "pppd je prestao sa radom sa 2.4.x Linux kernelom"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Typical error messages in the system log:"
msgstr "Tipična poruka greške u dnevniku sistema:"

#. Tag: screen
#: kppp-faq.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"pppd[1182]: pppd 2.3.11 started by user, uid 500 \n"
"pppd[1182]: ioctl(PPPIOCGFLAGS): Invalid argument \n"
"pppd[1182]: tcsetattr: Invalid argument \n"
"pppd[1182]: Exit."
msgstr ""
"pppd[1182]: pppd 2.3.11 pokrenut od strane korisnika, uid 500 \n"
"pppd[1182]: ioctl(PPPIOCGFLAGS): Nevažeći argument \n"
"pppd[1182]: tcsetattr: Nevažeći argument \n"
"pppd[1182]: Izlaz."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install pppd 2.4.0b1 or better. See <filename>Documentation/Changes</"
"filename> in the kernel sources for more info."
msgstr ""
"Instalirajte pppd 2.4.0b1 ili bolji. Pogledajte <filename>Documentation/"
"Changes</filename> u izvorima kernela za više informacija."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Why does &kppp; tell me <errorname>Unable to open the modem</errorname>?"
msgstr "Zašto mi &kppp; govori <errorname>Nemoguće otvoriti modem</errorname>?"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This means that &kppp; doesn't have permissions to open the modem device or "
"that you selected a modem device on the <guilabel>Modem</guilabel> Tab "
"Dialog that is not valid. First make sure you selected the right modem "
"device. Once you are sure you have selected the right modem device, you must "
"give &kppp; the right permission to access the modem device and to be able "
"to modify <filename>/etc/resolv.conf</filename> in case you want &kppp; to "
"configure <acronym>DNS</acronym> correctly for you. If you can afford to run "
"&kppp; setuid <systemitem>root</systemitem> this would solve all access "
"problems for you, if not you will have to figure out what the right "
"permissions are for your purposes. In order to give &kppp; setuid "
"<systemitem>root</systemitem> permissions do the following:"
msgstr ""
"Ovo znači da &kppp; nema dozvolu da otvara modem uređaj ili da ste odabrali "
"modem uređaj na <guilabel>Modem</guilabel>  Dijalogu za kartice koji nije "
"validan. Prvo se uvjerite da ste ispravno odabrali uređaj. Kada budete "
"sigurni da jeste, morate dati &kppp; ispravna dopuštenja da pristupi Vašem "
"uređaju i da mu bude omogućeno da modificira <filename>/etc/resolv.conf</"
"filename> u slučaju da želite da  &kppp; konfiguriše <acronym>DNS</acronym> "
"ispravno za Vas. Ukoliko si možete priuštiti da pokrenete &kppp; setuid "
"<systemitem>korijen</systemitem> ovo će Vam riješiti sve probleme pristupa, "
"a ako ne, morat ćete istražiti koja su ispravna dopuštenja za Vaše potrebe. "
"Da biste dali &kppp; setuid <systemitem>korijen</systemitem> dopuštenja "
"uradite sljedeće:"

#. Tag: screen
#: kppp-faq.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>su</command> <option>root</option></"
"userinput>\n"
"<prompt>#</prompt> <userinput><command>chown</command> <option>root:root "
"&dollar;KDEDIR/bin/kppp</option></userinput>\n"
"<prompt>#</prompt> <userinput><command>chmod</command> <option>+s &dollar;"
"KDEDIR/bin/kppp</option></userinput>\n"
"<prompt>#</prompt> <userinput><command>exit</command></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>su</command> <option>korijen</"
"option></userinput>\n"
"<prompt>#</prompt> <userinput><command>chown</command> <option>root:root "
"&dollar;KDEDIR/bin/kppp</option></userinput>\n"
"<prompt>#</prompt> <userinput><command>chmod</command> <option>+s &dollar;"
"KDEDIR/bin/kppp</option></userinput>\n"
"<prompt>#</prompt> <userinput><command>izlaz</command></userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why does &kppp; tell me it can't create a modem lock file?"
msgstr ""
"Zašto mi &kppp; govori da ne može da kreira zaključanu datoteku modema."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This in most instances means that you have installed &kppp; without setuid "
"bit on while you, the person executing &kppp;, doesn't have write access to "
"the lock file folder which by default is <filename class=\"directory\">/var/"
"lock</filename>. This for example is the case on &RedHat; systems. Check the "
"modem dialog for the precise location you have chosen. The solution is easy "
"-- either run &kppp; setuid if you can afford to, or give regular users "
"write access to <filename class=\"directory\">/var/lock</filename> or create "
"a modem group that will have access to the <filename class=\"directory\">/"
"var/lock</filename> file."
msgstr ""
"Ovo najčešće znači da ste instalirati &kppp; bez setuid bita postavljenog, "
"osoba koja izvršava &kppp;, nema prava pristupa da zaključa direktorij koji "
"je <filename class=\"directory\">/var/lock</filename>. To je na primjer "
"slučaj na &RedHat; sistemima. Provjerite modemski dijalog za preciznu "
"lokaiju koju ste odabrali. Rješenje je jednostavno -- ili pokrenite &kppp; "
"setuid ako možete, ili dajte običnim korisnicima pravo pisanja u <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/lock</filename> ili kreirajte modemsku grupu koja "
"će imati pristup <filename class=\"directory\">/var/lock</filename> datoteci."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why is &kppp; installed with the setuid bit on?"
msgstr "Zašto je &kppp; instaliran sa uključenim setuid bitom?"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is no need for the setuid bit, if you know a bit of &UNIX; systems "
"administration. Simply create a <systemitem>modem</systemitem> group, add "
"all users that you want to give access to the modem to that group and make "
"the modem device read/writable for that group. Also if you want "
"<acronym>DNS</acronym> configuration to work with &kppp;, then <filename>/"
"etc/resolv.conf</filename> must be read/writable by the members of that "
"group. The same counts for <filename>/etc/ppp/pap-secrets</filename> and "
"<filename>/etc/ppp/chap-secrets</filename> if you want to use the built-in "
"<acronym>PAP</acronym> or <acronym>CHAP</acronym> support, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Nema potrebe za setuid bitom, ako znate suštinu &UNIX; sistema "
"administracije. Jednostavno kreirajte  <systemitem>modem</systemitem> grupu, "
"dodajte sve korisnike kojima želite dati pristup modemu u tu grupu i "
"postavite uređaj dostupnim za čitanje/pisanje za tu grupu. Također, ako "
"želite da <acronym>DNS</acronym> konfiguracija radi sa &kppp;, tada "
"<filename>/etc/resolv.conf</filename> mora biti dostupan za čitanje/pisanje "
"od strane članova te grupe. Isto vrijedi i za <filename>/etc/ppp/pap-"
"secrets</filename> i <filename>/etc/ppp/chap-secrets</filename> ako želite "
"da  koristite ugrađenu <acronym>PAP</acronym> ili <acronym>CHAP</acronym> "
"podršku, respektivno."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kppp; team has lately done a lot of work to make &kppp; setuid-safe. "
"But it's up to you to decide if you install and how you install it."
msgstr ""
"&kppp; tim je u posljednje vrijeme uradio mnogo posla da napravi &kppp; "
"setuid-sigurnim. Ali na Vama je da odlučite da li da ga instalirate i kako "
"da ga instalirate."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You might also want to read the <link linkend=\"security\">Security</link> "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Možda biste također željeli da pročitate <link linkend=\"security"
"\">Security</link> sekciju."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"What do I do when &kppp; just sits there and waits with the message: "
"<computeroutput>Expecting OK</computeroutput>"
msgstr ""
"Šta da uradim kada &kppp; jednostavno sjedi i čeka sa porukom: "
"<computeroutput>Očekuje se OK</computeroutput>"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "Have you played with the CR/LF setting? Try CR, LF or CR/LF."
msgstr "Jeste li pokušali sa CR/LF postavkama? Probajte CR, LF or CR/LF."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, your modem might need some time to respond to its "
"initialization. Open the <guilabel>Modem Commands</guilabel> dialog on the "
"<guilabel>Modem</guilabel> tab and adjust the <guilabel>Pre-Init</guilabel> "
"and <guilabel>Post-Init</guilabel> delays. See if you are successful when "
"drastically increasing their values, and then do some fine-tuning later."
msgstr ""
"Alternativno, Vašem modemu možda treba malo vremena da odgovori na "
"incijalizaciju. Otvorite dijalog <guilabel>Komande Modema</guilabel> na "
"kartici i prilagodite <guilabel>Pre-Init</guilabel> i <guilabel>Post-Init</"
"guilabel> odlaganja. Primijetit ćete da li je to bilo uspješno kada "
"drastično povečate njihove vrijednosti, i onda uradite fino ugađanje poslije."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "The connection works fine, but I can't start any applications!"
msgstr "Konekcija ispravno radi, ali ne mogu pokrenuti nijednu aplikaciju."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have probably selected the <link linkend=\"auto-configure-hostname"
"\">Auto Configure Host Name</link> option, and the X Server has problems "
"connecting to your newly named host. If you really need this option (and "
"chances are you really don't), you are unfortunately on your own to set up "
"the appropriate authorizations. Issuing <userinput><command>xhost</command> "
"<option>+</option></userinput> before starting the connection would do the "
"job, but be warned of the security risks involved, since this effectively "
"gives everyone else access to your X Server."
msgstr ""
"Vjerovatno ste odabrali <link linkend=\"auto-configure-hostname\">Auto "
"Configure Host Name</link> opciju, i X Server ima problema sa povezivanjem "
"na novijeg imenovanog domaćina. Ukoliko Vam zaista treba ova opcija (a "
"postoje šanse da ne treba zaista), na Vama je da postavite svrsishodnu "
"autorizaciju.  Izdavanjem komande <userinput><command>xhost</command> "
"<option>+</option></userinput> prije početka povezivanja bi trebalo odraditi "
"posao, ali budite na oprezu od sigurnosnog rizika koji je uključen, obzirom "
"da ovo efektivno pruža svima mogućnost pristupa Vašem X Serveru."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kppp; reports a successful connection, but &konqueror; just says "
"<errorname>Unknown host <replaceable>hostname</replaceable></errorname>, and "
"&Netscape; reports <errorname>The server does not have a DNS entry</"
"errorname>."
msgstr ""
"&kppp; prijavljuje uspješno povezivanje, ali &konqueror; govori "
"<errorname>Nepoznat domaćin <replaceable>hostname</replaceable></errorname>, "
"i &Netscape; izvještava <errorname>Server ne posjeduje DNS unos</errorname>."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Try pinging another server by its <acronym>IP</acronym> number, &eg; "
"<userinput><command>ping</command> <option>195.0.254.76</option></"
"userinput>. If that works, you could try the following:"
msgstr ""
"Probajte prozvati drugi server po njegovom <acronym>IP</acronym> broju, &eg; "
"<userinput><command>ping</command> <option>195.0.254.76</option></"
"userinput>. Ako to radi, možete pokušati sljedeće:"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check if you have provided &kppp; with at least one <acronym>DNS</acronym> "
"address."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite da li ste obezbijedili &kppp; sa najmanje jednom <acronym>DNS</"
"acronym> adresom."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check the contents of <filename>/etc/host.conf</filename>. There should be a "
"line saying something similar to <literal>order hosts, bind</literal>. The "
"<option>bind</option> keyword advises the resolver library to include a name "
"server query when performing an address lookup. If such a line is not there, "
"try adding it."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite sadržaj <filename>/etc/host.conf</filename>.Tu bi trebao nalaziti "
"dio koji govori o nečemu kao što je <literal>order hosts, bind</literal>. "
"Ključna riječ <option>bind</option> upućuje na to da rješavač biblioteke "
"uključi upit za ime servera kada se izvodi traženje addrese. Ukoliko takva "
"linija ne postoji, pokušajte je dodati."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How do I make &kppp; send a <keysym>\\n</keysym> or a <keysym>\\r</keysym>"
msgstr ""
"Kako da učinim da &kppp; pošalje <keysym>\\n</keysym> ili  <keysym>\\r</"
"keysym>"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid "Just send an empty string such as in the following script:"
msgstr "Jednostavno pošaljite prazan string baš kao u sljedećoj skripti:"

#. Tag: screen
#: kppp-faq.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Send                            # send an empty string\n"
"Expect           ID:            \n"
"Send             itsme\n"
"Expect           word:\n"
"Send             forgot\n"
"Expect           granted\n"
"Send             ppp"
msgstr ""
"Slanjem # šalje se prazan string\n"
"Očekivani ID:            \n"
"Slanje itsme\n"
"Očekivana riječ\n"
"Slanje zaborvaljeno\n"
"Očekivano odorenje\n"
"Slanje ppp"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How can I stop &kppp; complaining: <errorname>Can't create lock file</"
"errorname>?"
msgstr ""
"Kako da zaustavim &kppp; gunđanje: <errorname>Nije moguće kreirati "
"zaključanu datoteku</errorname>?"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This happens because you don't have permissions to create a lock file. If "
"you chose to use a lock file, you must have write permission to the folder "
"(typically <filename class=\"directory\">/var/lock</filename>). This is of "
"course no problem if you have given &kppp; setuid permissions. Please read "
"the section on <link linkend=\"lock-files\">Lock files</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ovo se dešava jer nemate dozvolu za kreiranje zaključane datoteke. Ukoliko "
"odaberete korištenje zaključane datoteke, morate imati dopuštenje za mapu "
"(obično <filename class=\"directory\">/var/lock</filename>). Ovo naravno "
"nije problem ukoliko ste dali &kppp; setuid dozvole. Molimo pročitajte "
"odlomak <link linkend=\"lock-files\">Zaključane datoteke</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why is my modem making so much noise when dialing?"
msgstr "Zašto moj modem uređaj pravi toliko buke dok se povezuje?"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on <guibutton>Setup</guibutton>, then <guilabel>Modem</guilabel>. You "
"can control the modem volume here in three steps: Off, medium and high. For "
"most modems, medium or high result in the same volume. If changing this "
"setting doesn't work, make sure the correct settings for your modem are "
"specified in <guibutton>Setup</guibutton>, <guilabel>Modem</guilabel>, "
"<guibutton>Modem Commands</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na <guibutton>Postavke</guibutton>, zatim <guilabel>Modem</"
"guilabel>. Tu možete kontrolisati glasnoću modema u tri koraka: Isključeno, "
"srednje glasno i glasno. Za većinu modema, srednje glasno i glasno rezultuju "
"istom glasnoćom.Ukoliko mijenjanje ovih postavki ne radi, uvjerite se da su "
"ipravne postavke za Vaš modem specificirane u <guibutton>Postavke</"
"guibutton>, <guilabel>Modem</guilabel>, <guibutton>Komande Modema</"
"guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I turned the modem volume to <quote>Off</quote> and verified the modem "
"commands, but I still hear that awful noise during dialing. Why?"
msgstr ""
"Promijenio/la sam glasnoću modema na <quote>Isključeno</quote> i provjerio "
"komande modema, ali još uvijek čujem tu groznu buku za vrijeme povezivanja. "
"Zašto?"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The volume initialization string can get lost if your modem can't cope with "
"the speed it is receiving commands from &kppp;. Increase the value of "
"<guilabel>Post-Init Delay</guilabel> in <guibutton>Setup</guibutton>, "
"<guilabel>Modem</guilabel>, <guibutton>Modem Commands</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Incijalizacioni string glasnoće može biti izgubljen ukoliko modem ne može "
"izaći na kraj sa brzinom primanja komandi od strane &kppp;. Povećajte "
"vrijednost <guilabel>Post-Init Kašnjenje</guilabel> u <guibutton>Postavke</"
"guibutton>, <guilabel>Modem</guilabel>, <guibutton>Komande Modema</"
"guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kppp; keeps reporting unusual modem speeds like <quote>115200</quote> or "
"<quote>57600</quote>"
msgstr ""
"&kppp; neprestano obavještava o neobičnim brzinama modema poput "
"<quote>115200</quote> ili <quote>57600</quote>"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many modems only report the speed of the serial line and not the speed over "
"the telephone line as default. You must configure these modems to report the "
"true line speed by adding some commands to the modem init or dial strings. "
"For many modems this command is <command>ATW2</command>. If you want to add "
"it to the dial string (which normally starts with <command>ATD</command>), "
"the new dial string would be <command>ATW2D</command>."
msgstr ""
"Mnogi modemi obavještavaju samo o brzini serijske linije a ne o brzini preko "
"telefonske linije prema zadanim postavkama. Morate konfigurirati takve "
"modeme da zaista obavještavaju o brzini linije dodavajući neke komande na "
"init ili dial stringove modema . Za mnoge modeme ova komanda je "
"<command>ATW2</command>. Ukoliko želite to dodati na dial string (koji "
"obično počinje sa <command>ATD</command>), novi dial string bi bio "
"<command>ATW2D</command>."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "Why does &kppp; report <quote>Unknown speed</quote>"
msgstr "Zašto &kppp; obavještava <quote>Nepoznata brzina</quote>"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"New modems often have very complex connection messages like "
"<computeroutput>CONNECT LAP.M/V42.bis/115000:RX/31200:TX</computeroutput>, "
"and &kppp; cannot parse this message correctly. Turn on <guibutton>Show Log</"
"guibutton> and you'll see the connection speed."
msgstr ""
"Novi modemi često imaju kompleksne poruke o konekciji kao što je "
"<computeroutput>CONNECT LAP.M/V42.bis/115000:RX/31200:TX</computeroutput>, i "
"&kppp; ne može korektno rasčlaniti ovu poruku. Upalite <guibutton>Prikaži "
"dnevnik</guibutton> i vidjet ćete brzinu konekcije."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid "I get a slow connection speed"
msgstr "Brzina konekcije mi je spora"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are not satisfied with the modem speed, make sure you've set the "
"connection speed (you can reach it by clicking on <guibutton>Setup</"
"guibutton>, <guilabel>Device</guilabel>, <guibutton>Connection Speed</"
"guibutton>) to 57600 or higher. Make sure your serial ports support higher "
"speeds. Many older systems based on i486 do not work correctly if you set "
"the speed to 115200. If you have an old <hardware>8250 UART</hardware> chip, "
"it won't work. If you have a <hardware>16550</hardware> or <hardware>16550A</"
"hardware> it should work flawlessly."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko niste zadovoljni brzinom modema, uvjerite se da ste postavili brzinu "
"konekcije (to možete uraditi klikom na <guibutton>Postavke</guibutton>, "
"<guilabel>Uređaj</guilabel>, <guibutton>Brzina konekcije</guibutton>) na "
"57600 ili više. Provjerite da li Vaši serijski ulazi podržavaju veće brzine. "
"Mnogi stariji sistemi bazirani na i486 ne rade korektno ako postavite brzinu "
"na 115200. Ukoliko imate stari <hardware>8250 UART</hardware> čip, to neće "
"raditi. Ako imate <hardware>16550</hardware> ili <hardware>16550A</hardware> "
"trebalo bi raditi besprijekorno."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally, you should consult your modem manual to look for init strings "
"that enable a high speed mode."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno, trebali biste provjeriti u priručniku modema  i potražiti init "
"stringove koji omogućavaju mod veće brzine."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid "I get a <emphasis>REALLY</emphasis> slow connection speed!"
msgstr "Dobio sam <emphasis>ZAISTA</emphasis> sporu konekciju!"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If data drips on at a rate of just a few bytes per second, you should check "
"your hardware setup. If moving your mouse speeds up the transmission this is "
"definitely a hardware issue!"
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko podaci kapaju brzinom od samo nekoliko bajta po sekunti, trebali "
"biste provjeriti postavke Vašeg hardvera. Ukoliko pomjeranje miša ubrzava "
"prijenos onda je definitivno problem sa hardverom!"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can obtain some information about your serial port with "
"<userinput><command>setserial</command> <option>-a <replaceable>/dev/ttySx</"
"replaceable></option></userinput> and check for interrupt conflicts with "
"other components of your system."
msgstr ""
"Možete dobiti neke informacije o serijskom ulazu na  "
"<userinput><command>setserial</command> <option>-a <replaceable>/dev/ttySx</"
"replaceable></option></userinput> i provjeriti konflikte prekida sa ostalim "
"komponentama Vašeg sistema."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"My phone line needs pulse dialing instead of tone dialing (or vice-versa). "
"How do I change that?"
msgstr ""
"Moja telefonska linija zahtijeva pulsno pozivanje umjesto tonskog pozivanja "
"(ili obrnuto). Kako da to promijenim?"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:325
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You must modify your modem dial string. Nearly all modems support the "
"following AT commands:"
msgstr ""
"Morate modificirati dial string Vašeg modema.Skoro svi modemi imaju podršku "
"za sljedeće AT komande:"

#. Tag: action
#: kppp-faq.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selects tone dialing"
msgstr "Odabir tonskog pozivanja"

#. Tag: action
#: kppp-faq.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selects pulse dialing"
msgstr "Odabit pulsnog pozivanja"

#. Tag: title
#: kppp-faq.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid "Questions about Telephone Cost Rules"
msgstr "Pitanja o Pravilima Telefonskih Troškova"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I write a telephones cost rules file?"
msgstr "Kako da napišem datoteku sa pravilima telefonskih troškova?"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Just follow the <filename>TEMPLATE</filename> rules file supplied with "
"&kppp;. You should be able to find a copy in <filename class=\"directory\">"
"$KDEDIR/doc/HTML/<replaceable>yourlang</replaceable>/kppp/</filename>. Use "
"the <option>-r</option> &kppp; command line option to check the syntax of "
"your proposed rules file."
msgstr ""
"Samo pratite <filename>TEMPLATE</filename> datoteku pravila  snadbjevenu sa "
"&kppp;. Trebali biste biti u mogućnosti pronaći kopiju u <filename class="
"\"directory\">$KDEDIR/doc/HTML/<replaceable>yourlang</replaceable>/kppp/</"
"filename>. Koristite <option>-r</option> &kppp; opciju komandne linije da "
"provjerite sintaksu Vaše predložene datoteke pravila."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have written a telephone cost rules for my region. Where can I submit it "
"so that others can make use of it?"
msgstr ""
"Napisao/la sam telefonske troškove za moju regiju. Gdje to mogu izložiti "
"kako bi i ostali imali korist od toga?"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:363
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Can my phone cost rulefile contain fractional time units like \"(0.17, "
"45.5)\"?"
msgstr ""
"Može li moj pravilnik o troškovima sadržavati razlomljene vremenske jedinice "
"kao što je \"(0.17, 45.5)\"?"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:365
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes this is possible. But you shouldn't use unusually small time units below "
"a tenth of a second, because this would result in higher <acronym>CPU</"
"acronym> load, although you probably won't notice on a modern <acronym>CPU</"
"acronym>."
msgstr ""
"Da, ovo je moguće. Ali ne biste trebali koristiti neobične male vremense "
"jedinice ispod desetine sekunde, obzirom da bi ovo rezultovalo većem "
"učitavanju <acronym>CPU</acronym>, obzirom da vjerovatno nećete "
"obavještavati o savremenom <acronym>CPU</acronym>."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid "My country observes other <quote>moving</quote> holidays than Easter."
msgstr ""
"Moja država podržava druge <quote>pomjerajuće</quote> praznike umjesto "
"Uskrsa."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In that case, you need to write new code that allows for the computation of "
"that holiday. Please have a look at <filename>ruleset.cpp</filename> and "
"emulate the <quote>easter</quote> example. Then send in the patches!."
msgstr ""
"U tom slućaju, trebat ćete napisati novi kod koji dopušta računanje tog "
"praznika. Molimo pogledajte na <filename>ruleset.cpp</filename> i imitirajte "
"primjer <quote>uskrs</quote>. Onda pošaljite prepravljeno!."

#. Tag: title
#: kppp-faq.docbook:382
#, no-c-format
msgid "Questions about the System Logs"
msgstr "Pitanja o Sistemskom dnevniku"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I see a message saying <errorname>Serial line is looped back</errorname>. "
"What does this mean?"
msgstr ""
"Vidim poruku koja govori <errorname>Serijska linija se u petlji</errorname>. "
"Šta ovo znači?"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Short answer: You didn't start the <acronym>PPP</acronym> software on the "
"peer system."
msgstr ""
"Kratak odgovor: Niste počeli <acronym>PPP</acronym> softver na virenju "
"sistema."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:397
#, no-c-format
msgid "The logs show <errorname>Signal 15</errorname>"
msgstr "Dnevnik pokazuje <errorname>Signal 15</errorname>"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you see the following lines, you've probably just received a timeout "
"error from &kppp;. &kppp; has been waiting for the <acronym>PPP</acronym> "
"interface to come up and gave up after the specified timeout. "
"<application>pppd</application> was signalled to shut down, with signal "
"number 15, &ie; <errorcode>SIGTERM</errorcode>."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko vidite sljedeće linije, vjerovatno ste primili grešku pauze od "
"&kppp;. &kppp; je čekao na <acronym>PPP</acronym>interfejs da završi i "
"odustao nakon specificirane greške pauze. <application>pppd</application> je "
"signalizirao gašenje, sa brojem signala 15, &ie; <errorcode>SIGTERM</"
"errorcode>."

#. Tag: screen
#: kppp-faq.docbook:405
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<computeroutput>\n"
"pppd[26921]: pppd 2.3.5 started by me, uid 500\n"
"pppd[26921]: Using interface ppp0\n"
"pppd[26921]: Connect: ppp0 &lt;--&gt; /dev/ttyS0\n"
"pppd[26921]: Terminating on signal 15.\n"
"pppd[26921]: Connection terminated.\n"
"pppd[26921]: Exit.\n"
"</computeroutput>"
msgstr ""
"<computeroutput>\n"
"pppd[26921]: pppd 2.3.5 započet od strane mene, uid 500\n"
"pppd[26921]: Korištenje interfejsa ppp0\n"
"pppd[26921]: Konektuj: ppp0 &lt;--&gt; /dev/ttyS0\n"
"pppd[26921]: Prekid na signal 15.\n"
"pppd[26921]: Veza prekinuta.\n"
"pppd[26921]: Izlaz.\n"
"</computeroutput>"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"What about <errorname>Receive serial link is not 8-bit clean</errorname>"
msgstr ""
"Šta o <errorname>Primanje serijskog linka koji nije čisti 8-bitni</errorname>"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:413
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <acronym>PPP</acronym> daemon is alarmed by the fact that all the data "
"it receives has bit 8 set to zero. In most cases this simply indicates that "
"the remote <acronym>PPP</acronym> server isn't running yet. You might still "
"be confronted by a login prompt that echoes back all the data sent by your "
"<application>pppd</application>."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>PPP</acronym> demon je alarmiran zbog činjenice da svi podaci koje "
"prima imaju bit 8 postavljen na nulu. U većini slučajeva ovo jednostavno "
"ukazuje na to da udaljeni <acronym>PPP</acronym> server još nije pokrenut.  "
"Mogli biste još uvijek biti suočeni sa ulaznim upitom koji vraća nazad sve "
"podatke koje je poslao Vaš <application>pppd</application>."

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:421
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"and <errorname>can't locate module ppp-compress</errorname>? What's this?"
msgstr ""
"i <errorname>nemoguće locirati modul ppp-compress</errorname>? Šta je ovo?"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:423
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do you see the following messages?"
msgstr "Da li vidite sljedeće poruke?"

#. Tag: screen
#: kppp-faq.docbook:426
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<computeroutput>\n"
"modprobe: can't locate module ppp-compress-21 \n"
"modprobe: can't locate module ppp-compress-26 \n"
"modprobe: can't locate module ppp-compress-24\n"
"</computeroutput>"
msgstr ""
"<computeroutput>\n"
"modprobe: can't locate module ppp-compress-21 \n"
"modprobe: can't locate module ppp-compress-26 \n"
"modprobe: can't locate module ppp-compress-24\n"
"</computeroutput>"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:429
#, no-c-format
msgid "Just add the lines:"
msgstr "Jednostavno dodajte linije:"

#. Tag: screen
#: kppp-faq.docbook:431
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>\n"
"alias ppp-compress-21 bsd_comp \n"
"alias ppp-compress-24 ppp_deflate \n"
"alias ppp-compress-26 ppp_deflate </userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>\n"
"alias ppp-compress-21 bsd_comp \n"
"alias ppp-compress-24 ppp_deflate \n"
"alias ppp-compress-26 ppp_deflate </userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: kppp-faq.docbook:433
#, no-c-format
msgid "to your <filename>/etc/conf.modules</filename> file."
msgstr "u Vašu <filename>/etc/conf.modules</filename> datoteku."
